<%- include('partials/head', { title }) %>

<header class="topbar">
  <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">E</span><span>EquiRoute</span></a>
  <div class="header-badges">
    <span class="mini-pill">4 API modules</span>
    <span class="mini-pill ai">Wallet Skill</span>
    <div class="mode-pill <%= apiStatus.mode === 'live' ? 'live' : 'demo' %>"><span class="pulse"></span><%= apiStatus.mode === 'live' ? 'Live Binance Web3' : 'Demo mode' %></div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="page">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">BNB Hack · Tokenized Stocks Edition</p>
    <h1>A pre-trade firewall<br />for tokenized stocks.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">A token can look only 0.2% away from the stock reference — while the quote you can actually execute is 1%+ worse. EquiRoute checks the real route, wallet readiness and market state before an agent or human trades.</p>
    <div class="hero-tags"><span>RWA Data</span><span>Trading API</span><span>Transaction API</span><span>Wallet API</span><span>Agentic Wallet-ready</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="workspace">
    <div class="form-card card">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Execution firewall</p><h2>Check a trade</h2></div><span class="safe-label">No broadcast</span></div>
      <form id="guard-form">
        <div class="field-grid two">
          <label class="field"><span>Stock ticker</span><input id="symbol" name="symbol" value="NVDA" maxlength="12" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Spend (USDT)</span><div class="input-suffix"><input id="amountUsd" name="amountUsd" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="500" /><b>USDT</b></div></label>
        </div>
        <label class="field"><span>Maximum acceptable execution premium</span><div class="range-row"><input id="maxPremiumPercent" name="maxPremiumPercent" type="range" min="0.1" max="5" step="0.1" value="1" /><output id="limit-output">1.0%</output></div><small>If every verified route is worse than this threshold, the firewall returns BLOCK.</small></label>
        <label class="field"><span>Your public BSC wallet address</span><div class="wallet-input-row"><input id="walletAddress" name="walletAddress" placeholder="0x..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" /><button class="secondary compact" type="button" id="connect-wallet">Connect wallet</button></div><small>Used only to request a wallet-specific live RFQ quote, check USDT funding and verify native BNB for gas. EquiRoute cannot sign, move funds or access your wallet.</small></label>
        <label class="deep-scan"><input id="deepScan" type="checkbox" checked /><span><strong>Liquidity stress probe</strong><small>Also re-quote the same representations at 5× order size to expose size-sensitive execution deterioration. Quote-only; never broadcast.</small></span></label>
        <button class="primary" type="submit" id="analyze-button"><span>Run execution firewall</span><span class="arrow">→</span></button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <aside class="policy-card card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Agent policy</p><h3>Never execute blind.</h3>
      <div class="policy-rule"><span>01</span><strong>live quote required</strong></div>
      <div class="policy-rule"><span>02</span><strong>premium ≤ <b id="policy-limit">1.0%</b></strong></div>
      <div class="policy-rule"><span>03</span><strong>wallet funded + gas ready</strong></div>
      <div class="policy-rule"><span>04</span><strong>BLOCK is a hard stop</strong></div>
      <p>The included Wallet Skill can place this policy in front of Binance Agentic Wallet: re-check immediately before execution, never bypass BLOCK, and still require explicit user confirmation.</p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section id="result-shell" class="result-shell hidden" aria-live="polite">
    <div id="decision-card" class="decision-card card"></div>
    <div class="metrics" id="metrics"></div>

    <div class="card routes-card">
      <div class="section-heading routes-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Route comparison</p><h2>Displayed price vs executable reality</h2></div><span id="result-mode" class="source-badge"></span></div>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Representation</th><th>Displayed gap</th><th>Executable premium</th><th>Hidden gap</th><th>Impact</th><th>Market</th><th>Guard</th></tr></thead><tbody id="routes-body"></tbody></table></div>
    </div>

    <div id="stress-card" class="card stress-card hidden">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Liquidity depth</p><h3 id="stress-title">5× size stress probe</h3></div><span class="safe-label">quote-only</span></div>
      <p class="muted" id="stress-copy"></p>
      <div id="stress-grid" class="stress-grid"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-grid three">
      <div class="card explanation-card"><p class="eyebrow">Money saved</p><h3 id="loss-title"></h3><p id="loss-copy"></p><div id="warnings" class="warnings"></div></div>
      <div class="card safety-card"><p class="eyebrow">Wallet preflight</p><div id="wallet-state" class="simulation-state"></div><p class="muted">Binance Wallet API checks USDT funding; BSC eth_getBalance verifies native BNB for gas. No signing permission is requested.</p></div>
      <div class="card safety-card"><p class="eyebrow">Transaction dry-run</p><div id="simulation-state" class="simulation-state"></div><p class="muted">RFQ execution can require EIP-712. EquiRoute dry-runs the required ERC-20 approval and leaves the actual trade to explicit user confirmation.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-grid">
      <div class="card trace-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Technical proof</p><h3>Live API trace</h3></div><span class="safe-label">request-scoped</span></div><div id="api-trace" class="api-trace"></div><p class="muted">Latency and success state are collected per analysis without exposing API keys, wallet query parameters or signed payloads.</p></div>
      <div class="card agent-card"><p class="eyebrow">AI execution layer</p><h3>Agentic handoff</h3><p id="agent-status" class="muted"></p><pre id="agent-instruction"></pre><button type="button" class="secondary" id="copy-agent">Copy agent instruction</button></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="how-it-works"><p class="eyebrow">Under the hood</p><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Resolve + refresh</h3><p>Find bStocks/Ondo representations, refresh prices and hydrate underlying market state.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Preflight wallet</h3><p>Check USDT and BNB readiness for the public wallet through Wallet API.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Quote + simulate</h3><p>Ask for a live executable RFQ route, optionally stress it at 5× size, and dry-run its approval transaction.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Enforce policy</h3><p>Expose the hidden execution gap and return ALLOW, CAUTION or BLOCK before any agent acts.</p></div></div></section>
</main>

<footer class="footer"><span>EquiRoute · BNB Smart Chain</span><span>Built for BNB Hack: Tokenized Stocks Edition</span></footer>
<div id="toast" class="toast hidden"></div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
